* test_set_logic: pset union / inter / not with 1 to 4 sets
* (see 00README). Membership is set by ranges of vertex numbers:
*   a = vertices 1-30, b = 21-45, c = odd, d = 1,4,7,... (60 vertices)
cmo / create / mo / / / hex
createpts / brick / xyz / 5 4 3 / 0. 0. 0. / 4. 3. 2. / 1 1 1
cmo / select / mo
cmo / addatt / mo / ma / vint / scalar / nnodes
cmo / setatt / mo / ma / 1 0 0 / 0
cmo / setatt / mo / ma / 1,30,1 / 1
pset / a / attribute / ma / 1,0,0 / eq 1
cmo / addatt / mo / mb / vint / scalar / nnodes
cmo / setatt / mo / mb / 1 0 0 / 0
