cmo / setatt / mo / md / 1 0 0 / 0
cmo / setatt / mo / md / 1,60,3 / 1
pset / d / attribute / md / 1,0,0 / eq 1
pset / u2 / union / a b
pset / u3 / union / a b c
pset / u4 / union / a b c d
pset / i2 / inter / a b
pset / i3 / inter / a b c
